{"name":"Carnival","hex":"#eb882c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Carnival","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["The season just before the beginning of the Western Christian season of Lent."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of carnival; especially in the sense \"any of a number of festivals held just before the beginning of Lent.\""]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Carnival"}],"entries":[{"title":"Carnival","blocks":[{"text":"Carnival is a festive season at the close of the Christian pre-Lenten period, consisting of Quinquagesima or Shrove Sunday, Shrove Monday, and Shrove Tuesday or Mardi Gras."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Lingelbach_Karneval_in_Rom_001.jpg/330px-Lingelbach_Karneval_in_Rom_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival","wikidata":"Q4618"},{"title":"Carnival (¥$ song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Carnival\" is a song by the American hip-hop superduo ¥$, composed of rapper Kanye West and singer Ty Dolla Sign, with American rappers Rich the Kid and Playboi Carti, from the duo's debut studio album, Vultures 1 (2024). It was written by West, Ty Dolla Sign, Digital Nas, Ojivolta, TheLabCook, the Legendary Traxster, Rich the Kid, and Playboi Carti, being produced by the former six. On February 15, 2024, \"Carnival\" was released as the third single from Vultures 1 by YZY on an EP pack."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b1/Kanye_West_and_Ty_Dolla_Sign_-_Carnival.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_(%C2%A5%24_song)","wikidata":"Q124556312"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/Desfile_Portela_2014_%28906185%29.jpg/500px-Desfile_Portela_2014_%28906185%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumb